rom=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/pjnNIzCJBFUH2kWSYnNt0Q6uEVdDqa2HfZAe75I9EWIOoenGmNVZ9Quf3QarSRBHV4hEs5EvEnjyHlKIwy3NtA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/pjnNIzCJBFUH2kWSYnNt0Q6uEVdDqa2HQJepKxQCaU3mwib6gw8keJqMVw57LeUoUzyMfNMjQwODib7aqlNoezEw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>学院预申请流程与学校相同（点击“阅读原文”），</span><strong><span><span>预推免报名批次与具体面试时间安排如下</span></span><span><span>：</span></span></strong></p><p><span>第一批：报名截止时间：2025年9月16日11:00，面试预计2025年9月17日（星期三）上/下午各一场；</span></p><p><span>第二批：报名截止时间：2025年9月18日11:00，面试预计2025年9月19日（星期五）下午一场。</span></p><p><span>*是否有其他批次，请关注学院官网或报名链接通知。请拟获得推免资格的同学，</span><span><strong><span>尽快报名</span></strong></span><span>，以免错过报名时间！</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/pjnNIzCJBFUH2kWSYnNt0Q6uEVdDqa2HQJepKxQCaU3mwib6gw8keJqMVw57LeUoUzyMfNMjQwODib7aqlNoezEw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>注意事项：</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>1、收到报名后，学院本着按批次先申请先审核的原则安排面试，择优选拔。请学生们关注邮箱信息。</span></span></strong></p><p><span>2、推免生最终报考录取信息以“推免服务系统”为准，推免生因填写信息虚假、错误造成的后果由本人承担。</span></p><p><span>3、对在申请过程中弄虚作假的学生，一经发现，即取消复试或录取资格，由推荐单位按学生管理规定进行相应处理。</span></p><p><strong><span>学院联系人：崔老师</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>联系方式：cjq@dhu.edu.cn，021-67792738</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/pjnNIzCJBFUH2kWSYnNt0Q6uEVdDqa2HI37N1vo1Mey7OtHxkE9X7nArU0cb5oS9uibdz6AQmMlQJAwycGufBTA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/pjnNIzCJBFUH2kWSYnNt0Q6uEVdDqa2HYGPtQoI0LhiajLic6Ric53dshEkoyiakgic45lcymxggj89cbiaiaRBomVWog/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"8d237875f00a0f7fba009344bed5a10e97035d4f447e0fae32a0960011b630ec","textLength":580,"sourceSha256":"6c723f6de4054498cf7aa819968833800cb786df0943a786e57624c74ec215c1","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a0348de4dc8f40d00600","title":"2025年东华大学生物与医学工程学院开展2026年接收推荐免试研究生预报名及面试的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:41.470984+00:00"}
